# The work queue merges bead by bead and the backlog re-renders its generated
# blocks from the merged queue. scripts/dev/queue (on main) registers these
# drivers and points them at main's scripts/render_backlog.py, so a push race
# replays cleanly; a plain `git pull` here without the drivers falls back to a
# line merge, which `python3 <main>/scripts/render_backlog.py --resolve` finishes.
.beads/issues.jsonl merge=beads-jsonl
BOSUN_FEATURE_BACKLOG.md merge=bosun-backlog
